      "ja": "熱電子発生装置として作用する電子管｛（熱電素子と燃料要素との構造的組合せＧ２１Ｃ３／４０；熱電子変換器を用いた原子力プラントＧ２１Ｄ７／０４；放射線源と熱電子変換器との構造的組み合わせ，例．原子力電池Ｇ２１Ｈ１／１０；熱または運動エネルギが，流体のイオン化とその流体からの電荷の除去により電気エネルギに変換される発電機Ｈ０２Ｎ３／００）｝",
      "en": "Discharge tubes functioning as thermionic generators {(structural combination of fuel element with thermoelectric element G21C3/40; nuclear power plants using thermionic converters G21D7/04; structural combination of a radioactive source with a thermionic converter, e.g. radioisotope batteries G21H1/10; generators in which thermal or kinetic energy is converted into electrical energy by ionisation of a fluid and removal of the charge therefrom H02N3/00)}",
      "count": 639,
      "ipcCode": "H01J45/00",
      "coreCode": "H01J45/00",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_H01J.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
